SUMMARY:Fleet Feet Run Crew
DESCRIPTION:Fleet Feet Run Crew\nA 3-mile walk or run with Davis’s neighborhood run club. Connect with other walkers and runners in Davis\, in a no-runner-left-behind format with different routes every week. Plus\, get a free shirt at your first run!\nEvery Tuesday\, 6pm Come join us it’s free.
